  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-项目管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"本接口支持批量修改巨量营销升级版项目ROI系数，当前仅应用、自动投放项目，电商、自动投放项目，电商、自动投放、周期稳投项目，小程序、自动投放项目支持ROI系数修改。\",\"id\":\"project.roigoal.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/project/roigoal/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1794208148473859\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口的返回码和返回信息需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"【附录-返回码】\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1794208148473859\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"批量修改项目ROI系数\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dBTQH%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-F8OoX36o%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AEROI%E7%B3%BB%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81ROI%E7%B3%BB%E6%95%B0%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%EF%BC%9A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Col%20data-id%3D%5C%22o9d5df12-CEk1yDS2%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-7YDsU5b4%5C%22%3E%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E3%80%81%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-A7wrkLqI%5C%22%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%95%86%E3%80%81%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-YoRhewgB%5C%22%3E%E7%94%B5%E5%95%86%E3%80%81%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E3%80%81%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E7%A8%B3%E6%8A%95%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-mk3J4XmO%5C%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E3%80%81%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Fol%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F8OoX36o\">本接口支持批量修改项目ROI系数，当前仅以下项目支持ROI系数修改：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-CEk1yDS2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7YDsU5b4\">应用、自动投放项目</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-A7wrkLqI\">电商、自动投放项目</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YoRhewgB\">电商、自动投放、周期稳投项目</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mk3J4XmO\">小程序、自动投放项目</li></ol></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201791297439447051%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-jPbmEWmP\" id=\"h346b9f0-jPbmEWmP\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-lhZLkKfO\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/roigoal/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/roigoal/update/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1794208148473859\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Wc1LO0h6\" id=\"h346b9f0-Wc1LO0h6\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-X6bM507b\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1CBG5dS1\" id=\"h346b9f0-1CBG5dS1\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pFqOTngn\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5RC6huoJ\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-p44hKV4a\" id=\"h346b9f0-p44hKV4a\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y5yPnqhy\">投放账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gSIx3UE4\">批量修改项目ROI系数，list长度限制10</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">project_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-H9NJulLR\">项目ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">roi_goal</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZdG7GRYA\">深度转化ROI系数，填写要求如下：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-dSBJH07L\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XUJAkcNA\">应用、自动投放项目，ROI系数范围[0.01,5]，仅支持最多4位小数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-almc01eA\">电商投放、自动投放项目，ROI系数范围[0.01,100]，仅支持最多4位小数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZYpKX87J\">电商投放、自动投放、周期稳投项目，ROI系数只允许调小且新建7天内每自然日最多允许成功修改1次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-54ZAiH7E\">小程序、自动投放项目，ROI系数范围[0.01,5]，仅支持最多4位小数</li></ol></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">shop_multi_roi_goals</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HB1D5Kd8\">电商平台多ROI系数设置，引流电商多平台投放ROI系数及平台信息，可按照电商平台分别确定ROI系数，分平台调控出价<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">，此能力白名单开放</span>。list长度最长为4</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-d13tYLwH\">填写条件：仅当满足以下5个条件时可传入，此时无需传入roi_goal参数：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-LJK95EGN\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2JxnjoIS\">landing_type = SHOP电商</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aHb9K8In\">delivery_mode = PROCEDURAL自动投放</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qqVnCZ65\">external_action = AD_CONVERT_TYPE_APP_ORDER APP内下单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-u88Lq0Dn\">deep_bid_type = ROI_DIRECT_MAILROI直投</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Gq63xPpA\">投放账户已经开通多ROI投放白名单，如有疑问请联系对接销售/运营</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-vxQLN17O\">填写要求：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-m7zOpV8s\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VBOYEHxY\">长度1-4</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rx4fY93s\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">单ROI（仅设置roi_goal）和多ROI项目（仅设置shop_multi_roi_goals）不支持同时传入修改</span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">roi_goal</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YSeLB8Ri\">ROI系数值，范围[0.01,100]，精度：最多保留小数点后四位</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">shop_platform</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-SUcugnq3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-re6wzlXq\"><code>JD</code> 京东</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cCJwT4xr\"><code>OTHER</code> 其他</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-zyKwLt0X\"><code>PDD</code> 拼多多</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-h5VeAVtu\"><code>TB</code> 淘宝</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-oj00aWIY\" id=\"h346b9f0-oj00aWIY\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.